{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-11-16 16:15:00', 'title': 'TECHCON LAUNCHES NEW MICRO-METER MIX TWO-COMPONENT DISPENSING SYSTEM', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , NOV. 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TECHCON, PART OF OK INTERNATIONAL\xa0AND DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV), AND A LEADER IN PRECISION FLUID DISPENSING TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF THE NEW TS8200D SERIES MICRO-METER MIX DISPENSING SYSTEM, A PRECISION VOLUMETRIC MIXING AND DISPENSING SYSTEM FOR TWO-COMPONENT ADHESIVES, SUCH AS EPOXIES, REACTIVE ACRYLICS, OR POLYURETHANES.'}